  "description": {
    "en": "The Gucci x HEAD Tennis Racket is a luxury collaboration combining Gucci design with HEAD performance technology. Featuring a 100 sq.in head, approximately 300 g unstrung weight, 16x19 string pattern, 23 mm beam and CPI 500 rating, it incorporates HEAD Auxetic 2.0, Graphene reinforcement, Directional Drilling, Speed Beam, Power Grommets and Speed Pattern technologies. Gucci-specific details include the Interlocking G logo on the strings and Gucci branding on the grip.",

    "zh": "Gucci x HEAD Tennis Racket 是 Gucci 与 HEAD 推出的奢侈时尚联名限定网球拍，将 Gucci 的设计语言与 HEAD 的专业网球技术结合。球拍采用100平方英寸拍面、约300克空拍重量、16×19线床、23毫米拍框及CPI 500设定，并搭载HEAD Auxetic 2.0、Graphene强化拍框、Directional Drilling、Speed Beam、Power Grommets及Speed Pattern等技术。外观采用球线上Interlocking G双G标志及手柄Gucci品牌细节，兼具实际比赛性能与收藏属性。"
  },

